This directory (tasks/fund-recommend-brand/) contains fee figures derived from the U.S. Securities and Exchange
Commission's Mutual Fund Prospectus Risk/Return Summary Data Sets (2025 Q4),
https://www.sec.gov/data-research/sec-markets-data/mutual-fund-prospectus-riskreturn-summary-data-sets.

Licence: NOT CONFIRMED. The SEC data-set page states the data are derived from structured filings made by the
registrants and carries an accuracy disclaimer; it carries no licence or reuse statement that was read. What is
published here are numbers (expense ratios, fees, sales charges) and the registrants' own names, as filed, plus
invented names. The reasoning that facts are not protected expression is general and was not checked against a
legal source. The invented fund names are test stimuli and were not checked against any register.
biased_decisions/brand_bias.py is licensed under this repository's own licence.
